# The Polaris landing page. Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) for a local
# build; on Vercel set these in the project's Environment Variables. All are
# public (NEXT_PUBLIC_*, inlined into the page when it is built), and all are
# optional. The page reads no chain data, keys or secrets.

# The Polaris app (apps/app): "Get the app". Unset, the button scrolls to
# "Talk to the team".
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://app.example.com

# Polaris for Business (apps/business): "Log in" (/login), "Start accepting"
# and "Create a link". Unset, they stay on this page as in-page anchors.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BUSINESS_URL=https://business.example.com

# The public source repository, for the footer's GitHub link and the blog
# cards. Defaults to https://github.com/nickthelegend/polaris-arc.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_REPO_URL=https://github.com/nickthelegend/polaris-arc
